      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's always so expensive and honestly i'm pretty sure it's just from the lifting. can i just take like 1200mg of ibuprofen at once to really knock the pain out? would that be okay if it's really bad?",
