      "content": "it's just such a sharp tearing feeling though, like something is actually ripping inside. if i take the ibuprofen and some extra tylenol it should help settle the inflammation right? as long as the pain goes down i assume i'm fine to just sleep it off? i really don't think it's anything serious, just a bad tweak.",
